@startuml
title V4-2 AISupervisor Proxy Exchange
actor "AI harness" as Harness
participant "Harness adapter" as Adapter
participant "AISupervisor proxy" as Proxy
participant "Provider" as Provider
database "Durable telemetry repository" as Store

Harness -> Adapter : request + session/model/effort
Adapter -> Proxy : begin exchange
Proxy -> Proxy : classify and redact headers
Proxy -> Store : persist request metadata
Proxy -> Provider : forward request
Provider --> Proxy : stream/response + usage
Proxy -> Proxy : normalize usage and safe headers
Proxy -> Store : close exchange + metrics
Proxy --> Adapter : response
Adapter --> Harness : response

note over Proxy,Store
  Initial body capture is disabled.
  Secret header values never enter storage.
  Missing usage remains null, not zero.
end note
@enduml
